OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FToday will be largely cloudy
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of rain, with sometimes
OL,7,Fheavy, blustery showers in the far
OL,8,Fsouth with thunder possible. It will
OL,9,Fbe breezy in the northwest, with
OL,10,Ftemperatures near average but cooler
OL,11,Fthan Wednesday.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FTonight, there will be
OL,14,Fcontinued low cloud and outbreaks of
OL,15,Frain for most, turning drier by
OL,16,Fmornng. Breezy over high ground and
OL,17,Fchillier than Wednesday night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
