OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FAfter some patchy light rain
OL,6,Fto start, clouds will clear by the
OL,7,Fevening across Wales. Light winds and
OL,8,Ftemperatures dropping leading to
OL,9,Fpatchy overnight fog and widespread
OL,10,Ffrost.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCold
OL,13,FSaturday morning with frost, otherwise
OL,14,Fa dry and bright day for most. Rain
OL,15,Fapproaches the far south west Saturday
OL,16,Fevening, as winds increase and
OL,17,Funsettled weather dominates again.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
